; Host plugin — defines a form `swatch` whose `:hue` key qualifies its
; value-kind reference as `paint/color`. The qualification means even
; though `display` also declares `color`, the validator picks paint's
; member set and accepts `red`.
(plugin :name host :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name swatch
    (key :name hue :type paint/color :optional false)))
